  "slug": "fa-united",
  "name": "FA United",
  "shortName": "FAU",
  "description": "Fur Affinity: United (FA: United, FA:U) was an annual furry convention organized by the Northeast Anthropomorphic Association, a New Jersey 501(c)(7) non-profit, in partnership with Fur Affinity. Headed by Shy Matsi, planning began in 2005 after Anthrocon announced its move from Philadelphia to Pittsburgh. The title \"United\" reflected the goal of strengthening the furry community's bonds, and the convention focused on live music and entertainment, with rock bands performing each year. The first edition was held August 10 to 12, 2007, in Newark, New Jersey, and later editions took place in Mount Laurel and Whippany, New Jersey, and from 2016 at the Hyatt Regency Dulles in Herndon, Virginia. Twelve editions were held between 2007 and 2019, with attendance between 310 and 707, and the convention closed in December 2020.",
